pages.Out of Curiosity:
Out of Curiosity is a Quest in Escape from Tarkov.

## Failure Penalty

Therapist Rep -0.25

## Guide

By completing either Chemical - Part 4 or Big Customer, you will fail and lose access to this quest.

You can buy the MS2000 Marker from Prapor.
After placing the marker, the player must stay alive for 30 seconds or they will have to place another beacon in the van. You do not need to be near the van after the marker has been placed. Find a nearby hiding spot and wait until the timer is complete.

@img wiki/511604025d485926.jpg 560 261
@cap Warehouse marked on map
@img wiki/4c34e0cc933022c7.jpg 560 315
@cap The warehouse with the vehicle inside.
@img wiki/f5910f1908742cea.jpg 560 315
@cap The vehicle where the beacon is placed.

## Trivia

You can buy additional MS2000 Markers from Prapor or Ragman if needed.
It is recommended that the player keeps the MS2000 Markers in their special slots or pouch so they are not lost in the event of their death. However, unlike most quests that require you to mark an object, this one does require that you survive after placement. In the event of death, you will need to acquire another and re-place.
The MS2000 Markers will automatically be used out of the players' inventory when needed, similar to how keys work

