pages.Weapons Circulation:
Weapons Circulation is a Quest in Escape from Tarkov.

## Guide

### Woods

One can be found in the woods west of the sawmill near the checkpoint. This spot can easily be located when you go to the checkpoint, stay at the barrier and line your view up with a big stone south of it. See pictures below.

The other one is located at the dilapidated village in the north. The circle itself is north of the church in the backyard of a house.

@img wiki/2f761887d3496e89.jpg 560 402
@cap Location marked on map (bottom)
@img wiki/ff5fe26d7f6ff776.jpg 560 315
@cap View from the checkpoint towards the ritual spot
@img wiki/820bbe9534ba7230.jpg 560 315
@cap View from the ritual spot towards the checkpoint
@img wiki/1b0dc510a3697b80.jpg 560 315
@cap The marked circle
@img wiki/722f446b75695899.jpg 560 315
@cap The second ritual spot in the dilapidated village

### Shoreline

Located in the pig room (East wing room 321) on the third floor of the health resort on Shoreline. Like on Customs, the room is easily identified by candles and numerous markings on the door. Inside the room are multiple slaughtered pigs and a Dead Scav with a pig's head. The spot to plant the MS2000 Marker surrounds the bathtub with the Dead Scav.

@img wiki/cd65a8b6061c3773.jpg 560 315
@cap Health resort east wing location marked on map
@img wiki/19886d5991d3362e.jpg 560 229
@cap Room location marked on east wing map
@img wiki/1626e65a1447a4df.jpg 560 315
@cap The ritual spot where the marker needs to be placed

## Trivia

You can buy MS2000 Markers from Prapor or Ragman if needed.
It is recommended that the player keeps the MS2000 Markers in their special slots or pouch so they are not lost in the event of their death.
The MS2000 Markers will automatically be used out of the players' inventory when needed, similar to how keys work

